\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Status Verification (Figure~\ref{fig:m5_stack_status}):} The stack resolved all dependencies in parallel and transitioned to \texttt{Check Complete}.
    \item \textbf{Dependency Graph (Figure~\ref{fig:m5_stack_topology}):} Horizon visualizes the computed resource graph, explicitly mapping resource dependencies across compute, storage, and networking layers.
    \item \textbf{Output Resolution:} The stack dynamically returned the public URL, which successfully served the deployed web application on first attempt without human intervention.
\end{itemize}
